IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROBE-A06.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
SELECT IN-FILE ASSIGN TO "input.dat"
    ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS IN-STATUS.
SELECT OUT-FILE ASSIGN TO "output.dat"
    ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS OUT-STATUS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD IN-FILE.
01 IN-REC.
05 IN-TEXT PIC X(8).
FD OUT-FILE.
01 OUT-REC.
05 OUT-TEXT PIC X(8).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-STATUS PIC X(2).
01 OUT-STATUS PIC X(2).
01 VALUE-A PIC S9(3)V9(2) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE VALUE -1.25.
01 VALUE-B PIC S9(3)V9(2) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    MOVE VALUE-A TO VALUE-B
    DISPLAY VALUE-A VALUE-B
    ADD 0.50 TO VALUE-B END-ADD
    DISPLAY VALUE-A VALUE-B
    STOP RUN.
